 nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Since $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=3$ and ${x}_{2,3}=1\\pm 2\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=6,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =6(x-3)(x-(1+2\\text{i}))(x-(1-2\\text{i}))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6(x-3)(x-(1+2\\text{i}))(x-(1-2\\text{i})) & = \\\\ 6(x-3)({x}^{2}-x(1+2\\text{i})-x(1-2\\text{i})+(1+2\\text{i})(1-2\\text{i})) & = \\\\ 6(x-3)({x}^{2}-2x+5) & = \\\\ 6({x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+11x-15) & = \\\\ 6{x}^{3}-30{x}^{2}+66x-90.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=6{x}^{3}-30{x}^{2}+66x-90.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978465/state.json" "file_sha256" "c8179149af5d820ed0eb2e19e792a4ec4c728c3b52402a63736f26e093952932"} {"question" "q-316652" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978465/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "cf3a80d009bfbef82c6233d04ec4a7eaf0c49ef6660872e952b071df85ae8053"} {"question" "q-316652" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978465/state.json" "file_sha256" "c8179149af5d820ed0eb2e19e792a4ec4c728c3b52402a63736f26e093952932"} {"question" "q-316652" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978465/state.json" "file_sha256" "c8179149af5d820ed0eb2e19e792a4ec4c728c3b52402a63736f26e093952932"} {"question" "q-316652" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "cate